  "title": "The three pieces",
  "description": "The three stacked pieces of work Ford named on 2026-11-03, drawn bottom-up in one column. Piece 1 · Internal review is at the bottom, with a green solid frame because This Session builds it. It holds packages/workflows, the Review chain · 5 nodes subsection (Four review nodes in blue, plus one pink Coding-agent node) and pr-label binding. Piece 2 · Background dispatch is in the middle, with a dashed frame because a Later Session builds it. It holds Remote run locations (dev-01, Sandbox) stacked over Trace sync home (StateSink, TraceWriterSink). On the right are the Scheduler · services-01 and, beside it, Token Gateway · services-01, which is context the scheduler runs next to. Piece 3 · Non-coding runtime is at the top, also dashed. It holds Defined workflows (Email and transactions, Daily checklist, in blue as workflow node kinds) and the schedule/webhook Triggers. The two needs run as one straight blue dashed column on the right: pr-label binding → Scheduler (\"binding carries run location\") and Scheduler → Triggers (\"scheduler and triggers\"). The key and the notes sit in the bands between the pieces.",
